The actual form's vypocet_t1r8_C1 adds signed rows 4+5+6+7. The serializer
copies inputs 5/6/7 directly into XML, without a sign conversion. A paid,
covered bonus is negative on rows 5-7, a recovered amount is positive;
recap and internal funding figures retain their own positive convention.
XSD alone cannot prove this arithmetic relation.

The paper PREHLADv27 pattern and instructions were published 2026-09-29 in:
